102007703d67f8123261618d338b7cb1a250c639020adba391a92c9f66110552{"version":1,"source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"},"layers":{"businessProfile":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"a16729f973347159961501ed5c7d14e1921d406c7c52a12a8cab9ef52793c566","quote":"We are a global smart wearable and health technology leader. Since our inception in 2013, we have established a strong global presence, particularly in Europe and the U.S. To date, we have shipped over 200 million units of smart wearable devices and served more than 53 million users in over 90 countries with device activation in more than 150 countries.","context":"A. History and Development of the Company","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":594,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"365fe7293abd070b0850148b641893c75ce7cc82aa88967bc7be87306622388a","quote":"In December 2013, we commenced our operations in China with a focus on developing, manufacturing and selling smart wearable devices. A year later, in December 2014, we incorporated Zepp Health Corporation, previously knowns as Huami Corporation, in the Cayman Islands as our offshore holding company to facilitate financing and offshore listing. On February 8, 2018, our ADSs commenced trading on the NYSE under the symbol “HMI.”","context":"We are a global smart wearable and health technology leader. Since our inception in 2013, we have established a strong global presence, particularly in Europe and the U.S. To date, we have shipped over 200 million units of smart wearable devices and served more than 53 million users in over 90 countries with device activation in more than 150 countries.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":595,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"9adf29e26c4bb790396ab51e8a3a57f1766ab260faf463855f30ba420828728e","quote":"In February 2021, we, through Anhui Shunyuan Xinke Management Consulting Partnership (Limited Partnership), one of our subsidiaries in China, acquired 29.99% of the total outstanding shares of Jiangsu Yitong, a PRC company listed in Shenzhen Stock Exchange, for an aggregate consideration of US$144.89 million in cash to expand the healthcare ecosystem for Chinese market in the long term. The transaction was completed in February 2021. In May 2022, we, through Anhui Shunyuan Xinke Management Consulting Partnership (Limited Partnership), acquired another 0.01% of the total outstanding shares of Jiangsu Yitong for an aggregate consideration of US$35,238.","context":"In December 2013, we commenced our operations in China with a focus on developing, manufacturing and selling smart wearable devices. A year later, in December 2014, we incorporated Zepp Health Corporation, previously knowns as Huami Corporation, in the Cayman Islands as our offshore holding company to facilitate financing and offshore listing. On February 8, 2018, our ADSs commenced trading on the NYSE under the symbol “HMI.”","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":596,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"b29b5689f128a26d6750367f157708dc8484e1b30f56e6f4178fd46013c1b8c7","quote":"In February 2021, we rebranded ourselves from “Huami Corporation” to “Zepp Health Corporation” to emphasize our global recognition and expansion efforts. As part of this rebranding, we changed our trading symbol at the New York Stock Exchange from “HMI” to “ZEPP.”","context":"In February 2021, we, through Anhui Shunyuan Xinke Management Consulting Partnership (Limited Partnership), one of our subsidiaries in China, acquired 29.99% of the total outstanding shares of Jiangsu Yitong, a PRC company listed in Shenzhen Stock Exchange, for an aggregate consideration of US$144.89 million in cash to expand the healthcare ecosystem for Chinese market in the long term. The transaction was completed in February 2021. In May 2022, we, through Anhui Shunyuan Xinke Management Consulting Partnership (Limited Partnership), acquired another 0.01% of the total outstanding shares of Jiangsu Yitong for an aggregate consideration of US$35,238.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":597,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"956a9270d38956a4a49608f0ec5571ff683beba8d7627a919d39bd165586f58d","quote":"Our branding journey started in September 2015 when we started to use the brand name “Amazfit” to market our products, followed by the launch of the “Zepp” brand in August 2020 to broaden our portfolio. In March 2022 and August 2022, we launched Zepp Clarity, a hearing aid solution, and Zepp Aura, a mindfulness app, using personalized AI-powered soundscape to help users sleep, rest, and focus better, respectively.","context":"In February 2021, we rebranded ourselves from “Huami Corporation” to “Zepp Health Corporation” to emphasize our global recognition and expansion efforts. As part of this rebranding, we changed our trading symbol at the New York Stock Exchange from “HMI” to “ZEPP.”","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":598,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"cc3a2975fb35bbb5e57103998bd85746da895fa6390930a3de552491f1ca87b5","quote":"On September 16, 2024, we effected an ADS ratio change to adjust our ordinary share to ADS ratio from one ADS representing four Class A ordinary shares to one ADS representing 16 Class A ordinary shares.","context":"Our branding journey started in September 2015 when we started to use the brand name “Amazfit” to market our products, followed by the launch of the “Zepp” brand in August 2020 to broaden our portfolio. In March 2022 and August 2022, we launched Zepp Clarity, a hearing aid solution, and Zepp Aura, a mindfulness app, using personalized AI-powered soundscape to help users sleep, rest, and focus better, respectively.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":599,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"f2fd963e83508682ac17b72eb3c1fdc6dce3e20515e162dbea0106dd33dc1b6e","quote":"In August 2024, we commenced a two-year partnership with HYROX, the World Series of Fitness Racing. In April 2026, we entered into a new three-year global partnership with HYROX as its exclusive wearable technology provider, significantly expanding the previous regional collaboration into a worldwide agreement.","context":"On September 16, 2024, we effected an ADS ratio change to adjust our ordinary share to ADS ratio from one ADS representing four Class A ordinary shares to one ADS representing 16 Class A ordinary shares.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":600,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"28e26e2d11ef9032b9bc01bedde441524985f2df51d77bd9980916a66aeb348d","quote":"Our principal executive offices are located at Edisonweg 44 - B08, 4207 HG Gorinchem, The Netherlands. Our telephone number is +31 (0)616 086 658. Our registered office in the Cayman Islands is located at the offices of Maples Corporate Services Limited at PO Box 309 Ugland House, Grand Cayman, KY1-1104, Cayman Islands. Our agent for service of process in the United States is Puglisi & Associates, located at 850 Library Avenue, Suite 204, Newark, Delaware 19711.","context":"Table of Contents","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":603,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"1446b45493dc40f646caa2e9d3bd20bd997f61c933e34b17b75da3414125f05d","quote":"SEC maintains an internet site that contains reports, proxy and information statements, and other information regarding issuers that file electronically with the SEC on www.sec.gov. You can also find information on our website https://ir.zepp.com. The information contained on our website is not a part of this annual report.","context":"Our principal executive offices are located at Edisonweg 44 - B08, 4207 HG Gorinchem, The Netherlands. Our telephone number is +31 (0)616 086 658. Our registered office in the Cayman Islands is located at the offices of Maples Corporate Services Limited at PO Box 309 Ugland House, Grand Cayman, KY1-1104, Cayman Islands. Our agent for service of process in the United States is Puglisi & Associates, located at 850 Library Avenue, Suite 204, Newark, Delaware 19711.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":604,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"2a91dad283139ff6ff366136be42607c2c6ce4730edd3cd68da8d3d29e2a6979","quote":"We are a global smart wearable and health technology leader with operations in Europe, the U.S. and Asia. We empower users to achieve their well-being goals by optimizing their health, fitness, and wellness journeys through our leading consumer brands: Amazfit, Zepp Clarity, and Zepp Aura. Amazfit is a brand of smartwatches and wearables designed for various fitness levels and lifestyles, offering rich product offerings and full price-range coverage; Zepp Clarity offers discreet, AI-powered hearing aids to combat hearing loss; and Zepp Aura provides personalized, AI-generated soundscapes to improve sleep and relaxation. Our mission is to empower individuals to take control of their well-being through intelligent healthcare tools, and to create a world where healthcare is a source of empowerment, inspiration, and joy for all.","context":"B. Business Overview","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":606,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"f63c2e1fda5ee8b7710417d77a4ca3e4851133b087b7d1dfb9b2136ac159bcb0","quote":"Powered by our proprietary digital health management platform, which includes the Zepp OS—a proprietary operating system with high compatibility, scalability, and seamless application integration—AI chips, biometric sensors, hardware, and specialized health data algorithms, we deliver cloud-based actionable insights and guidance 24/7 to help users achieve their health goals. Our proprietary HuangShan 3 chip and biosensors leverage a cutting-edge open-source RISC-V architecture that delivers high performance at low cost. We have further enhanced our platform through generative AI solutions, including Zepp Flow, Zepp Coach, Zepp Aura, and Food Log features, which provide faster, more responsive user experiences at lower cost. Our devices deliver industry-leading GPS and heart-rate accuracy, long battery life and extended GPS operation time, advanced free offline maps, and comprehensive workout models with professional-level data across activities such as golf, free diving, and more. We maintain an integrated device, chip, and cloud strategy that supports a fast innovation cycle relative to the industry norm of over one year. We also maintain strong privacy protections, with compliance under GDPR and HIPAA frameworks and data stored on AWS infrastructure. We have also applied our AI expertise to emerging industrial medical imaging technologies delivering big data and analytics capabilities to support medical and diagnostics care service providers.","context":"We are a global smart wearable and health technology leader with operations in Europe, the U.S. and Asia. We empower users to achieve their well-being goals by optimizing their health, fitness, and wellness journeys through our leading consumer brands: Amazfit, Zepp Clarity, and Zepp Aura. Amazfit is a brand of smartwatches and wearables designed for various fitness levels and lifestyles, offering rich product offerings and full price-range coverage; Zepp Clarity offers discreet, AI-powered hearing aids to combat hearing loss; and Zepp Aura provides personalized, AI-generated soundscapes to improve sleep and relaxation. Our mission is to empower individuals to take control of their well-being through intelligent healthcare tools, and to create a world where healthcare is a source of empowerment, inspiration, and joy for all.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":607,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"e8eb46ac220a6345e3b301fcfe9aaaeca56eefa69d5d252318eea71e5953c44e","quote":"Since our inception in 2013, we have established a strong global presence, particularly in Europe and the U.S., supported by our own global sales channel and distribution network, a vertically integrated supply chain with multi-sourcing capabilities, and a localized talent base led by a globally experienced management team. To date, we have shipped over 200 million units of smart wearable devices and served more than 53 million users in over 90 countries with device activation in more than 150 countries. With outstanding craftsmanship, Amazfit smartwatches have won many design awards, including the iF Design Award and the Red Dot Design Award, reflecting our award-winning, industry-leading design philosophy and our commitment to ESG principles and sustainability. We are trusted by top athletes and have partnered with massively popular sport organizations such as HYROX, while benefiting from a flourishing third-party partner community and world-leading software ecosystem integrations, including Strava and TrainingPeaks.","context":"ithms, we deliver cloud-based actionable insights and guidance 24/7 to help users achieve their health goals. Our proprietary HuangShan 3 chip and biosensors leverage a cutting-edge open-source RISC-V architecture that delivers high performance at low cost. We have further enhanced our platform through generative AI solutions, including Zepp Flow, Zepp Coach, Zepp Aura, and Food Log features, which provide faster, more responsive user experiences at lower cost. Our devices deliver industry-leading GPS and heart-rate accuracy, long battery life and extended GPS operation time, advanced free offline maps, and comprehensive workout models with professional-level data across activities such as golf, free diving, and more. We maintain an integrated device, chip, and cloud strategy that supports a fast innovation cycle relative to the industry norm of over one year. We also maintain strong privacy protections, with compliance under GDPR and HIPAA frameworks and data stored on AWS infrastructure. We have also applied our AI expertise to emerging industrial medical imaging technologies delivering big data and analytics capabilities to support medical and diagnostics care service providers.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":608,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"322ce961d2c59d7d03059b12da865d10e98aae035699b055a0b124054d298858","quote":"Our key product and service offerings consist of (i) smart bands and smart watches, our core hardware products sold primarily under the Amazfit and Zepp brands, (ii) ecosystem products, including smart rings, hearables, the Helio Strap, smart scales, and accessories, and (iii) software and data services, including Zepp Aura, our AI-powered sound health platform, and our data analytics capabilities.","context":"Our Products and Services","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":610,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"2e4e47392bc4c2b342ce551f238728870fb060068b392108e13a75f1c5389368","quote":"We have developed a wide range of smart wearable devices that offer robust features at competitive price points, sold primarily under our proprietary Amazfit and Zepp brand names. Our product portfolio spans multiple form factors and styles, including round and rectangular display configurations, and targets a broad range of consumer use cases, from ruggedized outdoor and sports-oriented devices to fashion-forward and everyday lifestyle wearables.","context":"Smart Bands and Smart Watches","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":612,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"e232ffd40b5b677d0fd65f95c08c0a2864523be765b5f4d031ab16f494eab597","quote":"We pursue a strategy of rapid development and replacement cycles with shorter manufacturing runs, enabling us to bring new products to market quickly and stimulate consumer demand through compelling newly launched or updated offerings throughout the year. All of our products utilize our then-latest proprietary AI chipset and sensor array, which provides consistent biometric data collection across our product lines and enables users to connect with different terminals to improve Internet of Things (“IoT”) application scenarios. This standardized technology platform is a key differentiating benefit for our data analytics service offerings.","context":"Table of Contents","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":615,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"c28eb9a9cdc352805c68578235eec375174d52141f001706068379c8dbd24db4","quote":"We sell our own branded products under the Amazfit and Zepp brand names. In addition to the Amazfit product lines described below, we offer Zepp advanced smart watches, including the E and Z series. Our Amazfit-branded smart band and smart watch product lines are organized into the following principal series:","context":"We pursue a strategy of rapid development and replacement cycles with shorter manufacturing runs, enabling us to bring new products to market quickly and stimulate consumer demand through compelling newly launched or updated offerings throughout the year. All of our products utilize our then-latest proprietary AI chipset and sensor array, which provides consistent biometric data collection across our product lines and enables users to connect with different terminals to improve Internet of Things (“IoT”) application scenarios. This standardized technology platform is a key differentiating benefit for our data analytics service offerings.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":616,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"d0f3fdfb50041d4c5d122b59a66b86ebe60569ac8a3e9432bda940784ff189a4","quote":"Adventure and Performance Series. Our Adventure series, anchored by the Amazfit T-Rex product line, is designed for outdoor enthusiasts, modern explorers, and consumers seeking military-grade durability and advanced navigation features. The T-Rex series combines ruggedized construction with cutting-edge outdoor functionality and extended battery life. In September 2024, we unveiled the Amazfit T-Rex 3 smartwatch at the IFA Berlin trade event. Designed for the modern explorer, the Amazfit T-Rex 3 combines military-grade durability, cutting-edge outdoor navigation features, and unparalleled battery life, making it the ideal companion for adventure in everyday life. In September 2025, we launched the Amazfit T-Rex 3 Pro, designed for trailrunners, endurance athletes, and outdoor adventurers, which builds on its predecessor with upgraded materials, enhanced mapping, a flashlight, built-in speaker and microphone, a sapphire glass screen, and additional features. On February 19, 2026, we launched globally the T-Rex family’s new flagship, the T-Rex Ultra 2. Featuring a 51mm large-diameter design, the watch is built for diverse outdoor scenarios, delivering a more stable and reliable user experience. This upgrade covers multiple core areas, including a Grade 5 titanium bezel and back case, built-in global map resources, a white + green dual-light flashlight, and a GNSS maximum runtime of 177 hours, further enhancing the watch’s professional capabilities and exploration potential in challenging environments. Our Performance series includes the Amazfit Falcon and Amazfit Cheetah product lines, which are engineered for serious athletes and fitness enthusiasts seeking advanced training metrics and high-performance design.","context":"We sell our own branded products under the Amazfit and Zepp brand names. In addition to the Amazfit product lines described below, we offer Zepp advanced smart watches, including the E and Z series. Our Amazfit-branded smart band and smart watch product lines are organized into the following principal series:","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":617,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"9d6ca276312b1d5ff0d9ad66ee99758f3cbd992a52c672716b39f802c17e83a1","quote":"Lifestyle Series. Our Lifestyle series represents our broadest consumer-facing product category and includes the Amazfit Balance, Amazfit Active, Amazfit GTR, Amazfit GTS, and Amazfit GT mini product lines. These products are designed for everyday consumers and active individuals who seek a combination of health and fitness tracking, smart notifications, and versatile design suitable for both casual and professional settings. In the first quarter of 2025, we launched the Amazfit Active 2 smartwatch, featuring a round 1.32-inch high-definition AMOLED display capable of a peak brightness of 2,000 nits. In June 2025, we launched the Amazfit Balance 2 smartwatch, built for high performers, which supports daily training across multiple sports. In December 2025, we introduced the Amazfit Active Max, the newest member of the Amazfit Active series. Built for everyday athletes and consumers seeking to elevate their wellness routine, Active Max features a 1.5” ultra-bright AMOLED display, up to 25 days of battery life, podcast listening capability, and advanced training tools to support consistent training and clearer visibility across any activity.","context":"tting-edge outdoor navigation features, and unparalleled battery life, making it the ideal companion for adventure in everyday life. In September 2025, we launched the Amazfit T-Rex 3 Pro, designed for trailrunners, endurance athletes, and outdoor adventurers, which builds on its predecessor with upgraded materials, enhanced mapping, a flashlight, built-in speaker and microphone, a sapphire glass screen, and additional features. On February 19, 2026, we launched globally the T-Rex family’s new flagship, the T-Rex Ultra 2. Featuring a 51mm large-diameter design, the watch is built for diverse outdoor scenarios, delivering a more stable and reliable user experience. This upgrade covers multiple core areas, including a Grade 5 titanium bezel and back case, built-in global map resources, a white + green dual-light flashlight, and a GNSS maximum runtime of 177 hours, further enhancing the watch’s professional capabilities and exploration potential in challenging environments. Our Performance series includes the Amazfit Falcon and Amazfit Cheetah product lines, which are engineered for serious athletes and fitness enthusiasts seeking advanced training metrics and high-performance design.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":618,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"a5ffc0960cf15a7c20e249402a57a285f9ea1425946c2f4b3f64195d48b47595","quote":"Essential Series. Our Essential series, comprising the Amazfit Band 7 and the Amazfit Bip product lines, is designed to offer core smart wearable functionality at accessible price points. These products target first-time smart wearable users and cost-conscious consumers seeking reliable health and fitness tracking without the premium features of our higher-tier offerings. The Bip series has historically been among our most commercially successful product lines. In the first quarter of 2025, we launched the Amazfit Bip 6 smartwatch, which features a sturdy aluminum alloy frame, 5 ATM water-resistance, and an impressive two-week battery life.","context":"Lifestyle Series. Our Lifestyle series represents our broadest consumer-facing product category and includes the Amazfit Balance, Amazfit Active, Amazfit GTR, Amazfit GTS, and Amazfit GT mini product lines. These products are designed for everyday consumers and active individuals who seek a combination of health and fitness tracking, smart notifications, and versatile design suitable for both casual and professional settings. In the first quarter of 2025, we launched the Amazfit Active 2 smartwatch, featuring a round 1.32-inch high-definition AMOLED display capable of a peak brightness of 2,000 nits. In June 2025, we launched the Amazfit Balance 2 smartwatch, built for high performers, which supports daily training across multiple sports. In December 2025, we introduced the Amazfit Active Max, the newest member of the Amazfit Active series. Built for everyday athletes and consumers seeking to elevate their wellness routine, Active Max features a 1.5” ultra-bright AMOLED display, up to 25 days of battery life, podcast listening capability, and advanced training tools to support consistent training and clearer visibility across any activity.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":619,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"42cb1a3711606c90659112d10c5e227fb6c155f7797720781ddf29565b71c8bf","quote":"In addition to our core smart band and smart watch product lines, we offer a portfolio of complementary ecosystem products designed to extend our health and fitness monitoring capabilities across additional form factors and use cases. These ecosystem products integrate with our proprietary Zepp app and digital health management platform, enabling users to consolidate health data from multiple devices into a unified ecosystem.","context":"Ecosystem Products","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":621,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"2cb16da0ab20014e40194319818fc367d944c1371975f5dffcf7d58f8115e217","quote":"Hearables. We offer a range of smart earbuds and hearing aid products. In 2020, we introduced our first two smart hearable products, Amazfit PowerBuds and Amazfit ZenBuds, which incorporate health monitoring features. Amazfit PowerBuds is designed for listening use during exercise or outdoor activities and provides heart rate monitoring and data sharing with our Zepp app. In 2021, we introduced Amazfit PowerBuds Pro, an upgraded version featuring true wireless stereo with multi-scenario active noise cancellation and advanced health monitoring functions, including cervical vertebrae and hearing protection. In early 2022, we expanded into the healthcare segment with Zepp Clarity One, our flagship smart hearing aid—an adjustable, discreet device supported by audiology professionals to ensure optimal user experience. In 2023, we added Zepp Clarity Omni, an over-the-ear model with six programmable settings, and Zepp Clarity Pixie, a highly durable invisible hearing aid with a titanium alloy casing and medical-grade silicone domes. In 2024, we launched Amazfit UP OWS (Open Wearable Stereo) earbuds, designed for outdoor safety by allowing users to hear ambient sounds clearly while enjoying music.","context":"Table of Contents","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":624,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"2839fc0eb205833311c2aea3591df43f60e87c836e76a78f5bc5c3eac52c2432","quote":"Helio Strap. In June 2025, we launched the Helio Strap, Amazfit’s first screen-free fitness, recovery, and sleep tracker. The Helio Strap is designed as a complementary wearable for users who prefer a minimal, screen-free form factor while still accessing core biometric tracking capabilities through integration with the Zepp app and our broader device ecosystem.","context":"s. We offer a range of smart earbuds and hearing aid products. In 2020, we introduced our first two smart hearable products, Amazfit PowerBuds and Amazfit ZenBuds, which incorporate health monitoring features. Amazfit PowerBuds is designed for listening use during exercise or outdoor activities and provides heart rate monitoring and data sharing with our Zepp app. In 2021, we introduced Amazfit PowerBuds Pro, an upgraded version featuring true wireless stereo with multi-scenario active noise cancellation and advanced health monitoring functions, including cervical vertebrae and hearing protection. In early 2022, we expanded into the healthcare segment with Zepp Clarity One, our flagship smart hearing aid—an adjustable, discreet device supported by audiology professionals to ensure optimal user experience. In 2023, we added Zepp Clarity Omni, an over-the-ear model with six programmable settings, and Zepp Clarity Pixie, a highly durable invisible hearing aid with a titanium alloy casing and medical-grade silicone domes. In 2024, we launched Amazfit UP OWS (Open Wearable Stereo) earbuds, designed for outdoor safety by allowing users to hear ambient sounds clearly while enjoying music.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":625,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"8e1e71590dba607b77ed3167d7a60147a9ccb26bddadd5076c23530ef217f02a","quote":"Smart Rings. Smart rings, which offer advantages in monitoring accuracy and wearing comfort, represent an emerging product category in the smart wearables industry. We introduced our first smart ring product, the Amazfit Helio Ring, in January 2024. Among the lightest smart rings in the industry, the Amazfit Helio Ring features a water-resistance rating of 10 ATM. Designed to be worn alongside other Amazfit wearables or as a standalone device, the Amazfit Helio Ring offers functionalities beyond sleep tracking, including features tailored for athlete training and performance enhancement.","context":"Helio Strap. In June 2025, we launched the Helio Strap, Amazfit’s first screen-free fitness, recovery, and sleep tracker. The Helio Strap is designed as a complementary wearable for users who prefer a minimal, screen-free form factor while still accessing core biometric tracking capabilities through integration with the Zepp app and our broader device ecosystem.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":626,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"37d9f4a4d705c63fb0181ad896919f2232b357b506e655e4725fa065d7950279","quote":"Other Accessories and Products. We also offer a selection of complementary products, including the Amazfit Smart Scale, which we introduced in 2020. The Amazfit Smart Scale tracks metrics for 16 key body health indicators with high measurement accuracy and recognizes family members sharing the same account to facilitate user experience. In addition, we offer sportswear, home appliances, and various smart watch accessories.","context":"Smart Rings. Smart rings, which offer advantages in monitoring accuracy and wearing comfort, represent an emerging product category in the smart wearables industry. We introduced our first smart ring product, the Amazfit Helio Ring, in January 2024. Among the lightest smart rings in the industry, the Amazfit Helio Ring features a water-resistance rating of 10 ATM. Designed to be worn alongside other Amazfit wearables or as a standalone device, the Amazfit Helio Ring offers functionalities beyond sleep tracking, including features tailored for athlete training and performance enhancement.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":627,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"c30fc78681c3ed99b7052bf56921d3da3e843d2e010d792ad6c163925ec27570","quote":"Zepp Aura is a real-time, personalized sound health solution available in over 60 countries, designed to improve sleep quality through AI-generated music, daily tips, and seamless integration with smart wearable devices. It uses data from smartwatches—such as heart rate and relaxation index—to adapt music compositions from a scientifically crafted rhythm library, creating therapeutic soundscapes that promote relaxation, focus, and better holistic health. Evolving beyond sleep support, Zepp Aura now offers comprehensive health management, including emotional regulation and sports performance optimization, delivering customized recommendations based on real-time data and long-term trends to serve as a reliable health partner for users.","context":"Zepp Aura","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":629,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"b49dbea99c8e67b43297c333d89ad6dc905ff074e7a768b1b2870c30f1ae72d9","quote":"We had approximately 16.5 million Mobile App MAUs as of December 31, 2025, contributing to a large data set for health related data analytics. Mobile App MAUs refer to monthly active users of our mobile apps, which are represented by the number of accounts that have been logged into on our mobile apps during a given calendar month. We calculate Mobile App MAUs by using internal company data that have not been independently verified, and it is possible that some users may have set up more than one account.","context":"Data Analytics Capability","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":631,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"00abe8c31efd690b645faa3a4d1c9b827dea67950d0e49e3492a86163b739d55","quote":"In addition, we use the same algorithm in each of our products, regardless of price or type, which gives users a consistent experience and ensures the quality and format of the data collected is consistent, something that many of our competitors lack.","context":"We had approximately 16.5 million Mobile App MAUs as of December 31, 2025, contributing to a large data set for health related data analytics. Mobile App MAUs refer to monthly active users of our mobile apps, which are represented by the number of accounts that have been logged into on our mobile apps during a given calendar month. We calculate Mobile App MAUs by using internal company data that have not been independently verified, and it is possible that some users may have set up more than one account.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":632,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"390ff691efc0890806f466a0c45efa40cacb8c2c0d54538ff217928057e36534","quote":"Under strict guidance of our data privacy and security policies, we offer use of various sets of the data set we have accumulated. Use of user data may be individually identified or de-identified, depending upon the application, agreement with the company, and agreement with users. In some cases, users may opt-in to have their personal data seen by the population manager. Each use of data under data analytics services is specifically codified in contract language, with the default always to be protection of individuals’ personal identity and data, and only shared upon users’ specific instruction for opt-in.","context":"In addition, we use the same algorithm in each of our products, regardless of price or type, which gives users a consistent experience and ensures the quality and format of the data collected is consistent, something that many of our competitors lack.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":633,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"d268f5a201618aeb6fb5ab1a07a492e8f73e0b34fe1ee17f16a5a79c8413b442","quote":"Core Technology for Our Products and Services","context":"Table of Contents","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":636,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"259fabadd33cb8ff38d0955d19bace601c16d733220edf286cff821ed3307132","quote":"We design and develop our own core technology for smart devices, which we deem as a key competitive edge of our company as compared to many competitors who outsource their key components. We believe this give us an edge in product design for current and future products, as well as cost advantages.","context":"Core Technology for Our Products and Services","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":637,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"db66a81040f171e087daab75a6814bb438e18e1b2a8101fd07bb703d1e7e8721","quote":"In September 2018, we introduced the world’s first AI-powered wearable chipset, Huangshan-1. Leveraging the world’s first RISC-V open-source instruction set wearable processor, Huangshan-1 features four core artificial intelligence engines—cardiac biometrics engine, ECG, ECG Pro, and Hearth Rhythm Abnormality Monitoring Engine.","context":"Huangshan AI-Powered Smart Chipset","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":639,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"7d7074aaca49f3e7b3bebebed4141eb4cc955ecc979d05b8d5e83af3156aeccc","quote":"Huangshan-1 operates alongside an always-on (AON) module designed to transfer sensor data to internal static random access memory without waking the primary processor, with dedicated accelerators for neural network workloads. Huangshan-1 also supports real-time movement tracking, real-time biometric identification and real-time warning, among a huge array of functions. In addition, Huangshan-1 can scan the heart rate patterns of users through cloud-based AI, which helps monitor the user’s heart rate carefully, check for any unusual patterns and update users’ health statistics even when the users are not online. With lightning performance and minimal power consumption, Huangshan-1 has been applied on our Amazfit-branded health-oriented products since August 2019.","context":"In September 2018, we introduced the world’s first AI-powered wearable chipset, Huangshan-1. Leveraging the world’s first RISC-V open-source instruction set wearable processor, Huangshan-1 features four core artificial intelligence engines—cardiac biometrics engine, ECG, ECG Pro, and Hearth Rhythm Abnormality Monitoring Engine.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":640,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"7629526c8b7d7bb58eb17ccaa505a823ffae53145112d66460a76a72e3662cee","quote":"In June 2020, at a Zepp-sponsored AI Innovation conference, we announced our next generation of the Huangshan chipset, Huangshan-2. Based on RISC-V instruction set and a new independent neural network engine, the Huangshan-2 improves computing efficiency by 38% and can make software algorithms 26 times faster than other standard algorithms running on MCU core, at significantly lower power consumption than the Huangshan-1.","context":"Huangshan-1 operates alongside an always-on (AON) module designed to transfer sensor data to internal static random access memory without waking the primary processor, with dedicated accelerators for neural network workloads. Huangshan-1 also supports real-time movement tracking, real-time biometric identification and real-time warning, among a huge array of functions. In addition, Huangshan-1 can scan the heart rate patterns of users through cloud-based AI, which helps monitor the user’s heart rate carefully, check for any unusual patterns and update users’ health statistics even when the users are not online. With lightning performance and minimal power consumption, Huangshan-1 has been applied on our Amazfit-branded health-oriented products since August 2019.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":641,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"58817b3c63578aa7a82c1e3a6100ec1792730303de6653d7df4de30aa42db092","quote":"In July 2021, at our annual developers conference, we announced our new generation of smart wearable chip Huangshan-2S, the third generation Huangshan chip. Compared to its predecessor, the Huangshan-2S reduces operating power consumption by 56% and dormant power consumption by 93%, and improves graphics performance by 67%. Huangshan-2S smart wearable chips successfully taped out in March 2021, and have become one of the key smart wearable chips for our Amazfit smart watches.","context":"In June 2020, at a Zepp-sponsored AI Innovation conference, we announced our next generation of the Huangshan chipset, Huangshan-2. Based on RISC-V instruction set and a new independent neural network engine, the Huangshan-2 improves computing efficiency by 38% and can make software algorithms 26 times faster than other standard algorithms running on MCU core, at significantly lower power consumption than the Huangshan-1.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":642,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"3bea7d01de33f62c565ed55df28d925a5f992a6ff097ff4cc74f7ab51c877323","quote":"In September 2023, we agreed to transfer the technologies related to Huangshan-2/2S smart wearable chips to Whale Microelectronics Co., Ltd., a subsidiary of Jiangsu Yitong, an affiliate of our company, to further develop the next generation of Huangshan chipsets. For more details of the transfer of technologies, please see “Item 7. Major Shareholders and Related Party Transactions—B. Related Party Transactions—Other Transactions with Related Parties.” Starting September 2024, we introduce Hangshan-3 chips, which were developed by an affiliate of our company, in all of our product lines, which will bring us benefits such as more efficient chip functions and integrated chip platform, and enable our smartwatch to have cutting-edge performance, reducing R&D complexity and cost.","context":"In July 2021, at our annual developers conference, we announced our new generation of smart wearable chip Huangshan-2S, the third generation Huangshan chip. Compared to its predecessor, the Huangshan-2S reduces operating power consumption by 56% and dormant power consumption by 93%, and improves graphics performance by 67%. Huangshan-2S smart wearable chips successfully taped out in March 2021, and have become one of the key smart wearable chips for our Amazfit smart watches.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":643,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"3542ec2dc2608e40b3058c159fdf473e5d2c97a6401213b2250fdbec853d8932","quote":"We develop our own proprietary biosensor array for our smart devices. Like the Huangshan chipset, we believe this provides significant development and cost competitive advantages for our company.","context":"BioTrackerTM Sensor Array","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":645,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"81c6e3a8219501e1a0cc25e88deb4064600a39d2b31c2196b73b37172c940a79","quote":"In October 2021, we introduced the third generation of our biosensor array, BioTracker™ 3, into our smart watch products Amazfit GTS 3, Amazfit GTR 3 and Amazfit GTR 3 Pro. The BioTracker™ 3 monitors blood oxygen level, heart rate, stress level and sleep quality, providing users with easy-to-use enhanced health and sports experience. In September 2022, our brand new smart watch products Amazfit GTS 4 and Amazfit GTR 4 debuted the fourth generation of our biosensor array, BioTracker™ 4, which collects 33% more data and is more accurate than the previous generation. Combined with the upgraded heart rate tracking algorithm of the GT 4 series, the BioTracker™ 4 could efficiently distinguish heart rate signal from that contaminated by various motion noises, which almost reaches the tracking level of heart rate belts. In September 2023, we announced our latest generation of biosensor array, BioTracker™ 5, on Amazfit Balance and T-Rex 3. By taking advantage of deep learning and million minutes data, the BioTracker™ 5 achieves world-leading accuracy of heart rate tracking algorithm. Powered by the energy-efficient Zepp OS 3.0, the enhanced dual-LED and 8PD biometric sensor can support vital health metrics for longer measurement time.","context":"We develop our own proprietary biosensor array for our smart devices. Like the Huangshan chipset, we believe this provides significant development and cost competitive advantages for our company.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":646,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"7810b346d174d015f25e7ccec41cf2231c7cc3cb50d15638141b7ebb4d76dfb0","quote":"Our BioTracker™ sensor array now supports several AI-driven biologic data engines, including OxygenBeats™ blood-oxygen saturation monitoring, PumpBeats™ blood pressure monitoring, SomnusCare™ sleep monitoring, ExerSense™ exercise detection and monitoring, RealBeats™ heart rate monitoring, PeakBeats™ specialized post-workout data analysis, Readiness sleep quality tracking and improvement, and Zepp Coach™ workout plans personalization.","context":"Table of Contents","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":649,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"accfe025ed23e93f383adad04d38a7b9bdb782f573532946e155ecae896cd30b","quote":"We announced the new Zepp OS in July 2021, and have been upgrading its functions and features on an annual basis. Zepp OS is not only a smart watch operating system but also the core of an open platform, designed with emphasis on health, user experience and privacy protection with three key characteristics, namely being light, smooth and practical.","context":"Zepp OS Ecosystem","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":651,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"a7321e6d5dd0efe81d95f714d5947f4fdd764183162b07f63ca3f988b4baa54e","quote":"We explored multiple ways to integrate Generative AI (GenAI) with our business, as we have identified huge potential GenAI could bring to our daily lives. Through numerous cognitive revolutions and iterative reconstructions, on September 1, 2023, we launched Zepp OS 3, our AI-powered and health-focused wearable operating system, on Amazfit Balance. With leading connectivity, AI Chat capability and new health-focused applications such as Readiness and Pill Reminder, Zepp OS 3 is now being upgraded on our smart watches such as Amazfit GT series, Amazfit Cheetah series, Amazfit Falcon and Amazfit Active series on an ongoing basis. In addition, backed by Zepp OS 3 and partnered with Mastercard along with the integration of NFC technology, we introduced the new feature Zepp Pay on Amazfit Balance, which allows users to bind up to eight bank cards at a time to their smart wearable devices, for password-protected contactless payment directly from their wrist. Even if a bank is not supported, Zepp Pay can be used via simply signing up for a Curve account.","context":"We announced the new Zepp OS in July 2021, and have been upgrading its functions and features on an annual basis. Zepp OS is not only a smart watch operating system but also the core of an open platform, designed with emphasis on health, user experience and privacy protection with three key characteristics, namely being light, smooth and practical.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":652,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"44097f38aaf9ad9a2d145675ab4020f4fe7c1b82365ee274bbb16bda6cfe1740","quote":"On February 26, 2024, we unveiled Zepp OS 3.5, which applies the cutting-edge large language models and comes with the groundbreaking GenAI service Zepp Flow™, to facilitate a seamless connection between users and their devices all with just the voice, offering a refreshing experience with the language user interface embedded in our product portfolio. In the second quarter of 2024, we launched Zepp OS 4, a major leap in wearable tech by integrating OpenAI’s GPT-4, making Amazfit smartwatches more effective wellness companions. In the second quarter of 2025, we released Zepp OS 5 designed to enhance the athlete experience with a sport-focused interface, AI-powered training support, and smarter usability features, debuting on devices like the Amazfit Balance2. It introduces advanced personalization, improved movement intelligence, and innovative notification and music playback options tailored for active users.","context":"We explored multiple ways to integrate Generative AI (GenAI) with our business, as we have identified huge potential GenAI could bring to our daily lives. Through numerous cognitive revolutions and iterative reconstructions, on September 1, 2023, we launched Zepp OS 3, our AI-powered and health-focused wearable operating system, on Amazfit Balance. With leading connectivity, AI Chat capability and new health-focused applications such as Readiness and Pill Reminder, Zepp OS 3 is now being upgraded on our smart watches such as Amazfit GT series, Amazfit Cheetah series, Amazfit Falcon and Amazfit Active series on an ongoing basis. In addition, backed by Zepp OS 3 and partnered with Mastercard along with the integration of NFC technology, we introduced the new feature Zepp Pay on Amazfit Balance, which allows users to bind up to eight bank cards at a time to their smart wearable devices, for password-protected contactless payment directly from their wrist. Even if a bank is not supported, Zepp Pay can be used via simply signing up for a Curve account.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":653,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"f13ede88a04b0e7b61975837487bba727c0853ed460d761148f222a1296ebcde","quote":"Zepp OS provides a reliable and stable Bluetooth channel that seamlessly connects with smart phones, smart homes, other health devices and payment systems. We are also opening the Mini Program framework for developers, enabling them to create new apps that leverage the high-quality data and intelligence from our proprietary biosensor array and AI chip, creating a global open IoT ecosystem for smart wearable users. Through Bluetooth capabilities, Zepp OS supports numerous accessories, including body composition scale, body temperature, blood pressure monitor, heart rate monitor, cycling cadence & speed sensor, power meter, action camera, thermohygrometer, air quality monitor, and speaker, significantly enriching our hardware ecosystem. In 2025, Zepp OS further strengthened its ecosystem by supporting connections to professional sports platforms such as STRYD, and Intervals.icu. This integration provides more in-depth training data analysis and personalized guidance, making every workout more effective. Our inclusive and innovative Zepp OS ecosystem has now launched over 686 mini apps with over 61 million downloads. In addition, we are constantly expanding our technology footprint to attract more users to join our Zepp OS ecosystem. For example, we hosted the third Zepp OS Global Online Hackathon, an event designed to bring together some of the most creative minds in the app development.","context":"On February 26, 2024, we unveiled Zepp OS 3.5, which applies the cutting-edge large language models and comes with the groundbreaking GenAI service Zepp Flow™, to facilitate a seamless connection between users and their devices all with just the voice, offering a refreshing experience with the language user interface embedded in our product portfolio. In the second quarter of 2024, we launched Zepp OS 4, a major leap in wearable tech by integrating OpenAI’s GPT-4, making Amazfit smartwatches more effective wellness companions. In the second quarter of 2025, we released Zepp OS 5 designed to enhance the athlete experience with a sport-focused interface, AI-powered training support, and smarter usability features, debuting on devices like the Amazfit Balance2. It introduces advanced personalization, improved movement intelligence, and innovative notification and music playback options tailored for active users.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":654,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"f8bba3da81df1d379b1d1cdc6e6e37667d1e7c578ad27dc5d66f320e3a868622","quote":"PumpBeatsTM Blood Pressure Measurement System","context":"evelopers, enabling them to create new apps that leverage the high-quality data and intelligence from our proprietary biosensor array and AI chip, creating a global open IoT ecosystem for smart wearable users. Through Bluetooth capabilities, Zepp OS supports numerous accessories, including body composition scale, body temperature, blood pressure monitor, heart rate monitor, cycling cadence & speed sensor, power meter, action camera, thermohygrometer, air quality monitor, and speaker, significantly enriching our hardware ecosystem. In 2025, Zepp OS further strengthened its ecosystem by supporting connections to professional sports platforms such as STRYD, and Intervals.icu. This integration provides more in-depth training data analysis and personalized guidance, making every workout more effective. Our inclusive and innovative Zepp OS ecosystem has now launched over 686 mini apps with over 61 million downloads. In addition, we are constantly expanding our technology footprint to attract more users to join our Zepp OS ecosystem. For example, we hosted the third Zepp OS Global Online Hackathon, an event designed to bring together some of the most creative minds in the app development.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":655,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"122e9e8e98a32a4c580081dba3d7011add4eec9a25ba5fc37c06a40f4c4fc91d","quote":"In July 2021, we introduced PumpBeats™, a non-invasive and sleeveless blood pressure measurement system on Amazfit smart watches, which enables both spot measurement during day time and continuous monitoring during sleep. Based on five years of technical research and employing our proprietary biosensor array and Huangshan AI chip, the PumpBeats™ algorithm is able to measure blood pressure through the watch’s optical sensors in only 30 seconds. This feature provides users with easy, convenient, accurate readings anytime and anywhere throughout their busy day. PumpBeats™ was first tested in Amazfit GTR 3 Pro introduced in October 2021 and undertaken clinical trial by Peking University First Hospital and Hefei High-tech Zone Cardiovascular Hospital in 2022. In 2023, our blood pressure measurement software, supported by the spot measurement capability of PumpBeats™, was certified by National Medical Products Administration as Class II medical devices. Subsequently, we integrated the certified software into our products launched in the Chinese market in 2024. As of the date of this annual report, PumpBeats™ technology has been integrated across a number of our product lines, including T-rex series, Active series, BIP series and Balance series.","context":"PumpBeatsTM Blood Pressure Measurement System","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":656,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"4961ec2ad931f3a9c127c3dc84013de63bee1326e262a7eb5d27f9fe5e1f61c7","quote":"Launched in October 2022, the Amazfit Falcon debuted the Zepp Coach™, a smart coaching solution developed by us in-house, driven by both domain knowledge and AI. Zepp Coach™ offers AI-powered tailored guidance based on the user’s physical characteristics and workout experience level, to help them scientifically improve their sports performance and build better fitness habits. To help users train safely, the Zepp Coach™ can even detect whether the user is in an overtrained state, and appropriately reduce the intensity of scheduled exercise plans or recommend a rest day.","context":"Zepp CoachTM","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":660,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"31c3fbb177ab222a70b1c2d2edb1028f8c9da8ca427badbe7c3251c3ff9ac477","quote":"In 2023, an AI Chat function was provided to enhance Zepp Coach™ as a trial for users of Amazfit devices. By applying the domain knowledge controlled large language models, this intelligent chatbot can answer exercise-related questions which are in voice or text commands and provide users with abundant personalized and updated exercise recommendations. With this new AI Chat dimension, Zepp Coach™ not only can provide personalized training plans and guidance, but it also enables users to request specific advice which can assist their workout practices in real-time.","context":"Launched in October 2022, the Amazfit Falcon debuted the Zepp Coach™, a smart coaching solution developed by us in-house, driven by both domain knowledge and AI. Zepp Coach™ offers AI-powered tailored guidance based on the user’s physical characteristics and workout experience level, to help them scientifically improve their sports performance and build better fitness habits. To help users train safely, the Zepp Coach™ can even detect whether the user is in an overtrained state, and appropriately reduce the intensity of scheduled exercise plans or recommend a rest day.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":661,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"30914def6face1ae8659c4b4a4aa042fc004b2a914fa091b931d2b2e782ea49e","quote":"In 2024, we enhanced Zepp Coach™ with a Strength Training program designed to improve runners’ leg strength and overall performance. This program introduces a personalized, adaptive workout experience to build muscle strength and enhance running performance. It uses three core components: Goal Setting, Performance Estimation, and Training Navigation. Personalized plans are created based on user goals, experience, and available equipment. The algorithm uses Repetitions in Reserve (RIR) to track training intensity, ensuring optimal muscle growth with dynamic weekly and daily adjustments. The program follows a periodized structure with phases for muscle accumulation, intensity building, and performance realization. By integrating strength training into the Personal Health Navigation (PHN) ecosystem, users can boost leg strength, improve running efficiency, and achieve sustainable fitness progress.","context":"In 2023, an AI Chat function was provided to enhance Zepp Coach™ as a trial for users of Amazfit devices. By applying the domain knowledge controlled large language models, this intelligent chatbot can answer exercise-related questions which are in voice or text commands and provide users with abundant personalized and updated exercise recommendations. With this new AI Chat dimension, Zepp Coach™ not only can provide personalized training plans and guidance, but it also enables users to request specific advice which can assist their workout practices in real-time.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":662,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"21fdb83c6e5392871d30069fc93e16a5ac8e2b512840f5efd73ec2a02d436740","quote":"We mainly offer two mobile apps: our “Zepp” mobile app, formerly known as the “Amazfit” mobile app, and our “Zepp Life” mobile app, formerly known as the “Mi Fit” mobile app. Both of our mobile apps sync automatically with, and display real-time data from, our devices. They use charts and graphs to display analysis of the sports and biometric data collected from users. Our “Zepp Life” mobile app emphasizes functions relating to sports. In October 2025, we launched the enhanced Zepp App. This latest app version is designed to deliver more personalized sports and health analysis, empowering Amazfit users worldwide to understand their sports performance and health trends, and make informed lifestyle decisions.","context":"Zepp and Zepp Life Mobile Apps","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":664,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"f0775faf95e5b3e6424ff5d762193d3ab9e9e8249317aa30ca501abcb6e92d60","quote":"Since our inception in 2013, we have amassed a large user base. As of December 31, 2025, we had 389.3 million registered users of our mobile apps and 16.5 million Mobile App MAUs.","context":"We mainly offer two mobile apps: our “Zepp” mobile app, formerly known as the “Amazfit” mobile app, and our “Zepp Life” mobile app, formerly known as the “Mi Fit” mobile app. Both of our mobile apps sync automatically with, and display real-time data from, our devices. They use charts and graphs to display analysis of the sports and biometric data collected from users. Our “Zepp Life” mobile app emphasizes functions relating to sports. In October 2025, we launched the enhanced Zepp App. This latest app version is designed to deliver more personalized sports and health analysis, empowering Amazfit users worldwide to understand their sports performance and health trends, and make informed lifestyle decisions.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":665,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"83d3fe05cc8740b9fce9a5aa8ce7b659688fa73a8fe59fec8a83561e1d3e1b41","quote":"We developed our mobile apps to support and expand the functionalities of our smart wearable devices as a way to attract users and promote sales of our wearable devices. Backed by the Zepp OS architecture, which provides users with comprehensive sports and health insights through “24/7 sports and health monitoring,” we continue to provide innovative features and functionalities to users through our mobile apps. The Zepp App is a powerful, all-in-one sports and health platform that transforms every Amazfit device into a personalized performance coach. Designed for fitness-minded individuals who want to train smarter, recover better, and live healthier, we deliver advanced insights across body energy, sports, sleep, heart rate, stress, and nutrition.","context":"Since our inception in 2013, we have amassed a large user base. As of December 31, 2025, we had 389.3 million registered users of our mobile apps and 16.5 million Mobile App MAUs.","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":666,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"cbd9de4ae19fbe2d00cf9da5d46505253b64f201df973d0c0562677034724ac4","quote":"Our strong data technology is vital in enhancing the performance of our products and in further expanding their applications, as well as in enhancing our various data-enabled services.","context":"Data Technology","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":668,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"6cabee034a8151e4f527ca93be8e1af38bf54ef381cf9340893b916549c5c80d","quote":"Our big data storage system stores and processes a massive amount of multi-dimensional user data, including activity data and biometric data, which serves as the foundation of our big data technology. Based on the foregoing two types of data, we are able to derive additional personal data such as calories burned, BMI, body fat composition, heart health index, personal activity index and even calculate the likelihood of certain heart diseases. Additionally, we store and process user interaction voice data to evaluate and fine-tune a Natural-Language User Interface (LUI). This facilitates a seamless connection between users and their devices, allowing for natural, uninterrupted interaction through Zepp Flow. We also collect and analyze software and hardware error data and product defects data to optimize our products.","context":"Data Sources and Storage","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":670,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"897d6067b6cffe4475eb2c85dd110104b14623066803cc4db1ffc50bda009242","quote":"The real-time iteration of our big data model is enabled by our big data infrastructure and algorithms. Our data platform can extract multi-dimensional features from multi-source data in a highly efficient and secure way to support modeling. Abiding by the data security regulations, we currently utilize our big data technology in the following areas:","context":"Big Data Technology","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":674,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"44de9f86a65e78825da9846fb5a49e429f9f2b0ffb16a5caf5ca5eb9d06b1615","quote":"●optimize the algorithms that count the number of steps taken by eliminating the effect of certain patterns of the hand movements that are not associated with walking;","context":"The real-time iteration of our big data model is enabled by our big data infrastructure and algorithms. Our data platform can extract multi-dimensional features from multi-source data in a highly efficient and secure way to support modeling. Abiding by the data security regulations, we currently utilize our big data technology in the following areas:","section":"ITEM 4. INFORMATION ON THE COMPANY","block":675,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawP