y to further grow our business and enhance our competitive position, and is one of our core strategies. Since our inception in 2013, we have established a strong global presence, particularly in Europe and the U.S. To date, we have shipped over 200 million units of smart wearable devices and served more than 53 million users in over 90 countries with device activation in more than 150 countries.","context":"We are subject to a variety of costs and risks due to our continued expansion internationally that may not be successful and could adversely affect our profitability and operating results.","section":"If any of these risks materialize, our business, financial condition, results of operations and brand reputation could be materially and adversely affected.","block":294,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-048127","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-24","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001720446","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1720446/000110465926048127/zepp-20251231x20f.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f.bin","sha256":"c84e76ca59facce479f4f54f81b749a99449d55d257321321a7bccb33284720f"}},{"id":"46ed17c9352a57e3b205f5d985b4ada02df6ea706883b82aec52bc2800b81543","quote":"We may enter into new geographic markets where we have limited or no experience in marketing, selling, and localizing and deploying our products. International expansion has required and will continue to require us to invest significant capital and other resources and our efforts may not be successful. International sales and operations may be subject to risks such as:","context":"Table of Contents","section":"If any of these risks materialize, our business, financial condition, results of operations and brand reputation could be materially and adversely affected.","block":297,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"so